      "id": "claim_c4fa4b217c0c4942a570598f4f47a4c8",
      "statement": "The exported appPointsAtService step rewrites only the apiUrl line in src/environments/environment.ts to the service URL from admin.serviceToken(srvId), failing with an explicit error if the file has no apiUrl: '...' line; comments and feature flags are left untouched.",
