        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b2ad5577c62b4c9aaa60673e842794e7",
      "statement": "The user schema step's check compares a canonical form of the stored schema against USER_SCHEMA — sorted keys, store-added _id/_etag/$schema/$id dropped, _$date unescaped — so an outdated stored schema reports work outstanding and is rewritten; the schema itself requires only _id and roles, so a direct PUT /users/{id} is refused with required key [_id] not found while registration through /auth/register passes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.consents.ts#L165-L201",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ab644916f147a30f55751292e8001364f9783ea99e53cffff00aad5a6dbe9f0e:"
        },
        {
