    },
    {
      "id": "claim_250ad77d4a67435da8f82963e04675ad",
      "statement": "The consentsGate rule is written with action block and status_code 451, the status src/consents-signal.ts keys on, and is installed only after a dedicated step has installed the guards feature.",
